WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.320
What’s the deepest desire of Dorian,&nbsp;
the deeply depressed supernatural cat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.560
also known as SCP-607? We&nbsp;
warn you: It’s not pretty.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.800
SCP Foundation staff took a photo of it&nbsp;
with the Desire Camera while several staff&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.560
members were restraining it to clean its&nbsp;
ears. The resulting photo depicted both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.800
Dorian and everyone who was restraining&nbsp;
and cleaning him all dead on the floor.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.240
We told you it wasn’t pretty.

